{{Documentation/Header}}
Returns the date a page was created, as <code>YYYY-MM-DD</code>. It finds the page's earliest revision with DPL and formats that revision's timestamp.

==Syntax==
{{T|GetPageCreationDate|v1=page title}}

==Example==
{| class="wikitable"
! Code !! Result
|-
| <code><nowiki>{{GetPageCreationDate|Utaite Wiki:Tutorial}}</nowiki></code> || {{GetPageCreationDate|Utaite Wiki:Tutorial}}
|}

Give the '''full page title''', including any namespace prefix. An unknown page returns an empty string rather than an error.

{| class="dataTable sortable"
! Parameter !! Aliases !! Label !! Description !! Type !! Default !! Status
|-
